  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JLAC 2021: Safeguarding Jerusalemites&apos; Continued Presence through Countering Push- factor Violating their Human Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jerusalem Legal aid and Human rights center (JLAC) has worked to secure Palestinians human rights since its establishment, JLAC work focuses on safeguarding vulnerable communities in their homes and lands in East Jerusalem and Area C and the Palestinian Authority to account. The permanent residency status of Jerusalem makes them additionally subject to range of social ID revocation, the denial or restriction of family reunification and child registration and economic rights denial of health insurance and unemployment.</narrative>
  </description>
